[I] A Perl script beautifier

[T] Perltidy is a Perl script indenter and beautifier. By default it
[T] approximately follows the suggestions in perlstyle(1), but the style
[T] can be adjusted with command line parameters. Perltidy can also write
[T] syntax-colored HTML output.

[U] https://perltidy.sourceforge.net

[A] Steve Hancock <perltidy@users.sourceforge.net>
